{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手蘇永康向來被封為「廿四孝爸爸」的，與太太馮翠珊（Anita）婚後育有現年9歲的兒子蘇展弘（Jazz）。</p><p>蘇永康自兒子出生後，便減少幕前演出，專注家庭並事事以兒子為先。</p><p>近日蘇永康一早親自駕車送兒子返學，父子互動溫馨有愛，更令Jazz就讀的南</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:16:55.776880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:13.307603+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:13.307603+00:00","content_hash":"05cfd30d7e87e42381731ddef58ece2c691166cd641bca0bce4312e5367d7d7a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}